  "body": "## What's Changed\n* feat(zb_io): leave installed dependencies alone on install by @cachebag in https://github.com/zerobrewhq/zerobrew/pull/419\n* chore: point everything at the zerobrewhq organisation by @cachebag in https://github.com/zerobrewhq/zerobrew/pull/420\n* test: compare installed prefixes against homebrew by @cachebag in https://github.com/zerobrewhq/zerobrew/pull/424\n* fix: link directories the way homebrew does by @cachebag in https://github.com/zerobrewhq/zerobrew/pull/425\n* ci: time cold installs against homebrew and the last release by @cachebag in https://github.com/zerobrewhq/zerobrew/pull/426\n* perf: relocate mach-o in-process by @cachebag in https://github.com/zerobrewhq/zerobrew/pull/427\n* ci: comment the install timings on pull requests by @cachebag in https://github.com/zerobrewhq/zerobrew/pull/428\n* perf: relocate once in the store by @cachebag in https://github.com/zerobrewhq/zerobrew/pull/429\n* perf: reuse download connections by @cachebag in https://github.com/zerobrewhq/zerobrew/pull/430\n* perf: index the formula api by @cachebag in https://github.com/zerobrewhq/zerobrew/pull/431\n* perf: unpack bottles while downloading by @cachebag in https://github.com/zerobrewhq/zerobrew/pull/432\n* docs: changelog fixes + contribution housekeeping by @cachebag in https://github.com/zerobrewhq/zerobrew/pull/433\n* ci: time warm installs and heavy formulae by @cachebag in https://github.com/zerobrewhq/zerobrew/pull/434\n* bench: refresh the formula index untimed by @cachebag in https://github.com/zerobrewhq/zerobrew/pull/435\n* chore: prepare 0.4.0 release by @cachebag in https://github.com/zerobrewhq/zerobrew/pull/437\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/zerobrewhq/zerobrew/compare/v0.3.5...v0.4.0",
